{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>וְקָם</b> — <b>as Shalman's destruction</b>: perhaps it is Shalmaneser." "<b>בֵּית אַרְבֵּל</b>: a place name." "<b>רְטִשָׁה</b>: a noun, if referring to children, and since it is from the root אורב, it has no [valid] meaning."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {2 "The verse's בָּנִים may mean 'children'; the root analysis is Ibn Ezra's own."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:50:51.794619381Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}